  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children are protected - Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme activities to transform social, cultural and gender norms for reduction of violence against children, including child marriage and teenage pregnancy, also with a focus on returning married girls and teenage mothers to school. Other partners: Uganda Women Action Program (UWAP), WoMena, National Union for Disabled People in Uganda (NUDIPU), Building Community Initiatives for Development (BIDs), Uganda Child Rights NGO Network (UCRNN)</narrative>
  </description>
